# WINDOWS-PORT W10: Windows CI runners with core.autocrlf=true silently
# re-write .rs checkouts to CRLF, which breaks the raw-source scan pins
# (w4/w5/w6/w7/w8 read their own files and anchor on multi-line patterns).
# Pin LF for all text in the working tree on every OS; binary fixtures are
# unaffected (git auto-detects blobs already stored binary).
* text=auto
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.c text eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.desktop text eol=lf
VENDOR-NOTES text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
